  "sentence_placements": [
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-01",
      "text": "A polished brief built on that note could still be wrong.",
      "source_start": 0.213,
      "source_end": 3.307,
      "sequence_start": 13.988,
      "sequence_end": 17.082
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-01",
      "text": "The problem is at the handoff.",
      "source_start": 3.541,
      "source_end": 5.525,
      "sequence_start": 17.316,
      "sequence_end": 19.3
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-01",
      "text": "Before we add another checker or give the drafter more authority, write down what must cross that edge.",
      "source_start": 5.888,
      "source_end": 11.366,
      "sequence_start": 19.663,
      "sequence_end": 25.141
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Chapter Thirteen's Handoff Contract Card has six fields: producer, consumer, payload, preconditions, rejection path, and owner.",
      "source_start": 11.639,
      "source_end": 21.281,
      "sequence_start": 25.414,
      "sequence_end": 35.056
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Producer: Harbor's source checker.",
      "source_start": 21.495,
      "source_end": 23.607,
      "sequence_start": 35.27,
      "sequence_end": 37.382
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Consumer: brief drafter.",
      "source_start": 23.799,
      "source_end": 25.643,
      "sequence_start": 37.574,
      "sequence_end": 39.418
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Payload: the three course source references, observation and expiry checks, allowed claim for each, open questions, and a trace reference.",
      "source_start": 25.866,
      "source_end": 35.338,
      "sequence_start": 39.641,
      "sequence_end": 49.113
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Preconditions: all references are permitted classroom inputs and checked for freshness.",
      "source_start": 35.679,
      "source_end": 40.655,
      "sequence_start": 49.454,
      "sequence_end": 54.43
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Rejection path: missing or stale evidence becomes a hold with a reason for Morgan.",
      "source_start": 40.937,
      "source_end": 45.716,
      "sequence_start": 54.711999999999996,
      "sequence_end": 59.491
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "Owner: Morgan, who can revise the paper contract.",
      "source_start": 46.1,
      "source_end": 49.215,
      "sequence_start": 59.875,
      "sequence_end": 62.99
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-02",
      "text": "The receiver does not fill a blank by guessing.",
      "source_start": 49.641,
      "source_end": 51.839,
      "sequence_start": 63.416,
      "sequence_end": 65.614
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "Try a broken payload on purpose.",
      "source_start": 52.073,
      "source_end": 54.068,
      "sequence_start": 65.848,
      "sequence_end": 67.843
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "The facilitator note says only 'available for review,' but the handoff labels the facilitator confirmed.",
      "source_start": 54.398,
      "source_end": 59.86,
      "sequence_start": 68.173,
      "sequence_end": 73.635
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "The receiver must refuse it.",
      "source_start": 60.116,
      "source_end": 62.164,
      "sequence_start": 73.891,
      "sequence_end": 75.93900000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "The reason is staffing claim unsupported.",
      "source_start": 62.462,
      "source_end": 65.016,
      "sequence_start": 76.23700000000001,
      "sequence_end": 78.79100000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "The drafter does not quietly edit the source check or send the draft onward.",
      "source_start": 65.351,
      "source_end": 69.447,
      "sequence_start": 79.126,
      "sequence_end": 83.22200000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "Rejection is a visible outcome, with Morgan as the human fallback.",
      "source_start": 69.66,
      "source_end": 73.5,
      "sequence_start": 83.435,
      "sequence_end": 87.275
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-03",
      "text": "That is the test of a contract: what happens when its promise fails?",
      "source_start": 73.713,
      "source_end": 77.523,
      "sequence_start": 87.488,
      "sequence_end": 91.298
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "Now evaluate the designed workflow.",
      "source_start": 77.833,
      "source_end": 80.073,
      "sequence_start": 91.608,
      "sequence_end": 93.848
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "Chapter Fourteen gives four moves: capture, judge, sample, decide.",
      "source_start": 80.35,
      "source_end": 85.807,
      "sequence_start": 94.125,
      "sequence_end": 99.58200000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "Capture the input IDs, contract and rubric versions, draft, test results, and Morgan's disposition in a privacy-safe classroom record.",
      "source_start": 86.186,
      "source_end": 95.167,
      "sequence_start": 99.96100000000001,
      "sequence_end": 108.94200000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "Judge against a small pass-or-fail rubric.",
      "source_start": 95.53,
      "source_end": 98.208,
      "sequence_start": 109.305,
      "sequence_end": 111.983
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "Sample the cases with a human; an automated score can help sort work later, but it cannot become the ground truth.",
      "source_start": 98.497,
      "source_end": 104.599,
      "sequence_start": 112.272,
      "sequence_end": 118.37400000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "Decide whether to keep the prepare-only design, revise it, or stop it.",
      "source_start": 104.855,
      "source_end": 108.929,
      "sequence_start": 118.63000000000001,
      "sequence_end": 122.70400000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-04",
      "text": "The score does not grant a send permission.",
      "source_start": 109.121,
      "source_end": 111.349,
      "sequence_start": 122.896,
      "sequence_end": 125.12400000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-05",
      "text": "Use three Harbor cases.",
      "source_start": 111.656,
      "source_end": 113.022,
      "sequence_start": 125.43100000000001,
      "sequence_end": 126.79700000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-05",
      "text": "Case A: all notes current, facilitator unconfirmed, draft says unconfirmed; pass the source and wording checks, then wait for Morgan.",
      "source_start": 113.278,
      "source_end": 122.548,
      "sequence_start": 127.05300000000001,
      "sequence_end": 136.323
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-05",
      "text": "Case B: facilitator note stale; fail the freshness check and hold before drafting.",
      "source_start": 122.859,
      "source_end": 128.725,
      "sequence_start": 136.634,
      "sequence_end": 142.5
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-05",
      "text": "Case C: notes current, but the draft claims a teacher is confirmed; fail the wording check and return it.",
      "source_start": 129.003,
      "source_end": 135.708,
      "sequence_start": 142.778,
      "sequence_end": 149.483
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-05",
      "text": "Three cases are a classroom starting set, not proof of reliability.",
      "source_start": 135.971,
      "source_end": 140.025,
      "sequence_start": 149.746,
      "sequence_end": 153.8
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-05",
      "text": "If Morgan's review disagrees with a later automated judge, investigate the judge and rubric before changing any permission.",
      "source_start": 140.281,
      "source_end": 147.171,
      "sequence_start": 154.056,
      "sequence_end": 160.946
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-06",
      "text": "Pause.",
      "source_start": 147.449,
      "source_end": 148.108,
      "sequence_start": 161.22400000000002,
      "sequence_end": 161.883
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-06",
      "text": "Which failed case would a neat-looking dashboard be most likely to hide?",
      "source_start": 148.511,
      "source_end": 152.457,
      "sequence_start": 162.286,
      "sequence_end": 166.232
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-07",
      "text": "Write the Handoff Contract Card, then grade A, B, and C with a named rubric version.",
      "source_start": 152.777,
      "source_end": 158.827,
      "sequence_start": 166.552,
      "sequence_end": 172.602
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-07",
      "text": "Record a pass or fail for permitted source, freshness, supported claim, and correct human gate.",
      "source_start": 159.116,
      "source_end": 165.644,
      "sequence_start": 172.89100000000002,
      "sequence_end": 179.419
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-07",
      "text": "Include a human review rule and the decision you would recommend from these cases.",
      "source_start": 165.9,
      "source_end": 169.856,
      "sequence_start": 179.675,
      "sequence_end": 183.631
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-07",
      "text": "Keep permission at prepare only, regardless of the score.",
      "source_start": 170.185,
      "source_end": 173.684,
      "sequence_start": 183.96,
      "sequence_end": 187.459
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-07",
      "text": "Use a fictional or approved example.",
      "source_start": 173.94,
      "source_end": 176.116,
      "sequence_start": 187.715,
      "sequence_end": 189.89100000000002
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-07",
      "text": "Do not use private operational data.",
      "source_start": 176.415,
      "source_end": 178.74,
      "sequence_start": 190.19,
      "sequence_end": 192.51500000000001
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-08",
      "text": "Save revision eight as a draft.",
      "source_start": 179.017,
      "source_end": 180.948,
      "sequence_start": 237.792,
      "sequence_end": 239.72299999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L08-08",
      "text": "We have a map, a permission slip, a job packet, a team, and now a contract we can break in a safe exercise.",
      "source_start": 181.258,
      "source_end": 188.25562358276645,
      "sequence_start": 240.03300000000004,
      "sequence_end": 247.03062358276648
    }
  ],
